    - target: {fileID: 88269889357107111, guid: 98876a192c2029b4c82b4e85c57625a5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The operators say the system blackout was caused by a flooding, but
        I keep hearing voices in these sewers. I told this to the Operators and they
        just laughed in my face. They told me to stop wasting time and emphasized
        how important this job is. If you find this, don''t tell them.

        Just
        keep moving and act like nothing happend..'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
